  "title": "Skyward Specialty and Sixfold Partner to Advance AI-Powered Underwriting - Skyward Specialty Insurance",
  "summary": "Skyward Specialty announced a strategic partnership with Sixfold, an AI underwriting company transforming insurance workflows, to accelerate its progress toward fully AI-powered underwriting across U.S.-based property and casualty lines. The collaboration reinforces the Company’s commitment to data-driven, insight-rich underwriting by combining Sixfold’s AI-driven analysis with human expertise to enhance speed, consistency and decision quality.",
